  "description": "While grinding through another exhausting night of overtime, Yoon Se-hyeon spots a mindless \"Would You Rather\" game online: \"Work at your company for 30 years to get 1 billion won, OR let an alien watch you for 7 days to get 100 million won.\" Without thinking much of it, he picks the latter option...only for a real, live alien to pop up right in front of him. Now, Se-hyeon is officially stuck being alien's test subject for the next week. While he prepares for the worst, he realizes one critical detail: this alien is drop-dead gorgeous. Will Se-hyeon actually be able to make it back to his normal life after seven days?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
